        <headline>Extreme heatwave warning for Northern Territory</headline>
        <description>
        Maximum temperatures in the mid to high thirties over the Tiwi Islands and Daly district, to low forties over the Arnhem and Carpentaria districts and overnight minimum temperatures in the mid to high twenties.

Severe to Extreme heatwave conditions building and peaking over the mid to latter part of the week, with extreme heatwave conditions easing slightly into the weekend. 
        </description>
